    {
      "source": "A <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> using custom converters to handle query values in elasticsearch query. If the value to be\nconverted beyond the scope of custom converters, it'll delegate to the <code>delegated conversion\nservice</code>.",
